  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#FFD966><b>VFX Graph \uB85C \uB9CC\uB4E4 \uB54C\uC758 \uB178\uB4DC \uB808\uC2DC\uD53C</b></color>\n0. Create \u25B8 Visual Effects \u25B8 Visual Effect Graph (Simple Loop)\n1. <b>Spawn</b>: Constant Spawn Rate 10000/s (\uB610\uB294 Single Burst 50000)\n2. <b>Initialize Particle</b>: Capacity 50000\n   Set Position (Shape: Arc Circle, Radius 4, Surface)\n   Set Lifetime Random 4~6, Set Size 0.03~0.06\n3. <b>Update Particle</b>\n   Add Velocity = Cross(Position, (0,0,1)) \xD7 Spin  \u2190 \uACF5\uC804\n   Add Velocity = -Normalize(Position) \xD7 Pull   \u2190 \uBE68\uB824\uB4E6\n   Linear Drag 1,  Kill (Sphere) \uBC18\uC9C0\uB984 0.4 \uC548\uCABD\uC740 \uC81C\uAC70\n4. <b>Output Particle Quad</b>: Blend Additive\n   Color over Life (\uBD84\uD64D\u2192\uD30C\uB791), Size over Life\n5. Blackboard \uC5D0 Spin / Pull \uB178\uCD9C \u2192 \uC2A4\uD06C\uB9BD\uD2B8\uC5D0\uC11C\n   <b>visualEffect.SetFloat(\"Spin\", 1.5f)</b>\n\n<color=#9AA3B5>\uB300\uCCB4 \uAD6C\uD604: \uC785\uC790\uB9C8\uB2E4 \uC0AC\uAC01\uD615+\uC528\uC557\uAC12\uB9CC \uB2F4\uC740 \uBA54\uC2DC\uB97C \uD55C \uBC88 \uB9CC\uB4E4\uACE0,\n\uC704\uCE58\uB294 \uC170\uC774\uB354(Glossary/05_Effects/VortexPortal)\uAC00 GPU \uC5D0\uC11C \uACC4\uC0B0.\nVFX Graph \uB3C4 \uAC19\uC740 \uC774\uC720(GPU \uC2DC\uBBAC\uB808\uC774\uC158)\uB85C \uC218\uC2ED\uB9CC \uAC1C\uAC00 \uAC00\uB2A5\uD568</color>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8fef370121d393740a46a62c8052a3af, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1618710855667448384, guid: 8fef370121d393740a46a62c8052a3af, type: 2}
